- No new commands: this module replaces the prompt with starship's (when `starship` is installed)
- Default layout: user, host, directory, git branch and status, then `$` (red after a failed command)
- Config: `/home/j/.config/omnishell/starship.toml`, seeded on first run and never overwritten by the module, so your edits stay
- `STARSHIP_CONFIG` points at that file; see https://starship.rs/config/ for the settings
- Conflicts with the `omnishell-prompt` module: enable only one of them
